prise Portfolio and Delivery, you will lead the development and continuous improvement of UniSC's organisational change and benefits realisation capability. Join our talent community! Sign up for job alerts First Name (required) 66c51810 Last Name (required) 518f6f51 Email (required) d396874d Job Alert 5fe1d2f6 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Clinical Trials Individual contributor L7 $105,843 - $115,703 +17% super Nursing Professional Clinical Trials Individual contributor L7 $105,843 - $115,703 +17% super Nursing Professional Employment Type Full-Time Full-Time Locations UniSC Sunshine Coast, QLD, Australia UniSC Sunshine Coast, QLD, Australia Send Please wait... Done Not You? Congratulations from the UniSC Talent Acquisition Team, you are now signed up for UniSC job alerts. Apply now! Enter your details below to commence your application: First Name (required) d294e5c9 Last Name (required) e6cfbe2e Email (required) 061c6f7b Refer someone to this job Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Video Player is loading. Play Video Play Skip Backward Skip Forward Mute Current Time 0:00 / Duration 3:17 Loaded : 0% 0:00 Stream Type LIVE Seek to live, currently behind live LIVE Remaining Time - 3:17 1x Playback Rate Chapters Chapters Descriptions descriptions off , selected Subtitles subtitles settings , opens subtitles settings dialog subtitles off , selected Audio Track Picture-in-Picture Fullscreen This is a modal window. Beginning of dialog window. Escape will cancel and close the window. Text Color White Black Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Text Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta Cyan Opacity Opaque Semi-Transparent Transparent Caption Area Background Color Black White Red Green Blue Yellow Magenta