nic to support compliant, high-quality research, ensuring ethical protocols, Good Clinical Practice standards, and impactful outcomes are met. Administration Officer (Program Support) UniSC Sunshine Coast Academic Support Unit, Administration / Admin Support, L5 $82,843 - $93,358 +17% super Join UniSC and play an important role in supporting high-quality learning and research experiences for Honours and HDR students. Senior Clinical Trial Coordinator UniSC Sunshine Coast Clinical Trials, Individual contributor, L7 $105,843 - $115,703 +17% super, Nursing, Professional Join UniSC and lead clinical trial teams to deliver high-quality, ICH/GCP-compliant research, using expert coordination, problem-solving and innovative approaches to drive successful trial outcomes. Change Manager - Timetabling UniSC Sunshine Coast Individual contributor, Information Technology, L8 $118,986 - $134,756 +17% super Join UniSC’s PACE transformation and lead organisational change for a major evolution of the University’s timetabling and learning and teaching environment, helping staff and stakeholders successfully navigate and embrace new ways of working. Join our talent community! Sign up for job alerts First Name (required) 6cfe22ee Last Name (required) 1e011877 Email (required) 7e70363b Job Alert 7bf9d120 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Campus Development and Services Casual Professional Food and Beverage L3 $43.98 per hour (casual) Campus Development and Services Casual Professional Food and Beverage L3 $43.98 per hour (casual) Employment Type Casual Casual Locations UniSC Moreton Bay, Queensland, Australia UniSC Moreton Bay, Queensland, Australia Send Please wait... Done Not You? Congratulations from the UniSC Talent Acquisition Team, you are now signed up for UniSC job alerts. 