s Reset Done Close Modal Dialog End of dialog window. Recommended for you Clinical Trial Associate UniSC SouthBank Clinical Trials, Individual contributor, L5 $82,843 - $93,358 +17% super, Professional Join UniSC's SouthBank clinic to support compliant, high-quality research, ensuring ethical protocols, Good Clinical Practice standards, and impactful outcomes are met. Administration Officer (Program Support) UniSC Sunshine Coast Academic Support Unit, Administration / Admin Support, L5 $82,843 - $93,358 +17% super Join UniSC and play an important role in supporting high-quality learning and research experiences for Honours and HDR students. Senior Clinical Trial Coordinator UniSC Sunshine Coast Clinical Trials, Individual contributor, L7 $105,843 - $115,703 +17% super, Nursing, Professional Join UniSC and lead clinical trial teams to deliver high-quality, ICH/GCP-compliant research, using expert coordination, problem-solving and innovative approaches to drive successful trial outcomes. Change Manager - Timetabling UniSC Sunshine Coast Individual contributor, Information Technology, L8 $118,986 - $134,756 +17% super Join UniSC’s PACE transformation and lead organisational change for a major evolution of the University’s timetabling and learning and teaching environment, helping staff and stakeholders successfully navigate and embrace new ways of working. Join our talent community! Sign up for job alerts First Name (required) db475205 Last Name (required) 4a3ab4d1 Email (required) f631454a Job Alert e8c52fa0 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Casual Professional Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Casual Professional Employment Type Casual Casual Locations UniSC Caboolture, QLD, Australia UniSC Fraser Coast, QLD, Australia 